5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that keeps the door open for newcomers without exposing everyone's private costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Before we pick a fee, we must ensure the next treasurer isn't buried in administrative work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The current system hides how uneven the actual participation is among our members.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,People are hesitating to commit to evenings; the fee structure is making them overthink it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess next year's costs. We need hard data on what we can actually count on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the admin load is too high, any fee model will fail eventually.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, exactly. I want to see the hours logged by the last treasurer.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I need to know who is actually showing up versus who is just paying.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation is real. I want to see the turnout numbers since the summer.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I need the ledger to see where the money actually goes, not just what we collect.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the taster forms to understand why people don't join.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the bank statements to see how many people need reminders.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will tally the sign-in sheets to see the real distribution of attendance.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the winter social feedback to understand the quiet members' concerns.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will review the ledger and the mid-year joiner records to fix the calculation errors.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see what the data says before we argue about the numbers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Logic over emotion. Let's get the facts.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The data will show who is carrying the weight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Hopefully it shows why people are pulling back.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,No more guessing. We fix this properly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
